lib.jpe&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-r from-[#0C1714] via-[#13231E]/90 to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-12 py-16 sm:py-20 relative z-10 w-full\"><nav class=\"flex text-xs text-[#C5A059] mb-6 font-medium tracking-wide\"><span class=\"hover:underline opacity-80 cursor-pointer\">Home</span><span class=\"mx-2\">&gt;</span><span class=\"text-white/90\">Contact Us</span></nav><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-3 mb-4\"><span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#C5A059] font-semibold\">GET IN TOUCH</span></div><h1 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-serif font-normal tracking-tight text-white max-w-4xl leading-tight mb-6\">Connect with IRITAQ Departments</h1><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-2xl font-light mb-10 leading-relaxed\">Reach the right IRITAQ department, researcher, or international office through organized enquiry desks. Departments and enquiry types can be added or updated by the administrator anytime.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><a href=\"#enquiry-form\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3.5 bg-[#21674E] hover:bg-[#1B543F] text-white text-sm font-medium rounded-full transition-colors duration-200\">Contact Us<svg class=\"w-4 h-4 ml-2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"#staff-directory\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3.5 bg-transparent border border-white/40 hover:border-white text-white text-sm font-medium rounded-full transition-colors duration-200\">View Staff Directory</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 sm:py-20 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"mb-12\"><div class=\"flex i