ate\"><svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 mr-2 shrink-0 text-[#C5A059]\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" d=\"M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z\"></path></svg><span>+91 800 123 0001</span></a></div></div><div class=\"border border-gray-200/80 rounded-xl p-6 bg-white hover:shadow-md transition-shadow flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#FAF5EC] flex items-center justify-center mb-5\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-[#C5A059]\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" d=\"M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-base font-serif text-[#1E3E34] font-medium mb-2.5\">Academic Affairs</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed font-light mb-6\">Enquiries regarding curriculum, academic collaborations, faculty appointments, and dean&#x27;s office.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-2 border-t border-gray-100 pt-4 text-xs font-medium\"><a href=\"mailto:academics@iritaq.edu.in\" class=\"flex items-center text-[#21674E] hover:underline truncate\"><svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 mr-2 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" d=\"M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z\"></path></svg><span class=\"truncate\">academics@iritaq.edu.in</span></a><a href=\"tel:+91 800 123 0002\" class=\"fle